# Repo-specific ignores. The shared set lives in
# node_modules/@branchleft/prettier-config/prettierignore and is passed as a
# second --ignore-path; this file is named explicitly in the format scripts
# because passing any --ignore-path replaces Prettier's default rather than
# adding to it.

# Written by `pulumi config set`, not by hand. Prettier leaves these alone
# today, but the tool rewrites them wholesale on every config change and a
# formatter fighting it would produce diff churn in a file that carries KMS
# ciphertext.
Pulumi.*.yaml
